
## Operator workflow

1. Run `bin/simple test test/01_unit/compiler/frontend/lexer_types_spec.spl`.
2. Every scenario must pass; a failure is a regression in the
   behavior under test.

## Compatibility and limitations

Covers the interpreter and native lanes for the constructs
asserted here; platform-specific behavior is out of scope.
"""

use std.spec

    it "keyword-prefixed identifiers still lex as the keyword":
        # @req REQ-SSPEC-UNIT
        step("tokenize `value` and `classify`")
        # oracle: longer words starting with a keyword prefix are identifiers
        expect(kinds_of("value", 1)[0]).to_equal(TOK_IDENT)
        expect(kinds_of("classify", 1)[0]).to_equal(TOK_IDENT)
